<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>bitcoin++ · {{if .Event.Tag}}{{.Event.Location}} · {{end}}Event report</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/sponsor-report.css"><script src="/static/js/sponsor-report.js" defer></script></head>
<body>
<nav class="report-tools" aria-label="Report tools"><a href="/admin">← Admin</a><form method="get"><label>Event<select name="event" required><option value="">Choose an event</option>{{range .Options}}<option value="{{.Tag}}" {{if eq .Tag $.Event.Tag}}selected{{end}}>{{.Location}} · {{.Title}} · {{.Period}}</option>{{end}}</select></label><button>Open event report</button></form>{{if .Event.Tag}}<button type="button" id="report-print">Print / Save as PDF</button>{{end}}</nav>
{{if .Message}}<p class="notice" role="status">{{.Message}}</p>{{end}}
{{if not .Event.Tag}}<main class="report-page"><p class="eyebrow">Partner reports / By event</p><h1>One gathering.<br>A story worth sharing.</h1><p>Select an event to prepare its speaker highlights, program recap, hackathon results, and judge portraits.</p><div class="event-list">{{range .Options}}<a href="/admin/reports?event={{.Tag}}"><strong>{{.Location}} · {{.Title}}</strong><span>{{.Period}} →</span></a>{{else}}<p>No published events are available yet.</p>{{end}}</div></main>{{else}}
<details class="report-editor"><summary>Edit this event’s report</summary><p>Save before printing. Empty counts stay unreported. Select speakers and panels, confirm delivered sessions, and supply comparable views to rank talks.</p>
<form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{.CSRF}}"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="{{.Revision}}">
<fieldset><legend>Editorial notes</legend>{{range .Sections}}<label for="report-{{.Key}}">{{.Title}}</label><textarea id="report-{{.Key}}" name="{{.Key}}" rows="5" maxlength="12000">{{.Text}}</textarea>{{end}}</fieldset>
<fieldset><legend>Attendance &amp; applications</legend><p>Unique checked-in attendees are automatic. Daily attendance is not collected.</p><label>Verified talk applications received<input type="number" name="applications" min="0" max="1000000000000" value="{{with .Applications}}{{.}}{{end}}" placeholder="Not supplied"></label><label>Application count source<input name="applications_source" value="{{index .Saved "applications_source"}}" placeholder="CFP export, dates and inclusion rules" maxlength="12000"></label><p>{{.Proposals}} program proposal records exist. These may include invitations and admin-created sessions, so they are not automatically labeled applications.</p></fieldset>
<fieldset><legend>Highlighted speakers</legend><div class="editor-grid">{{range .Speakers}}<label class="check-label"><input type="checkbox" name="speaker_{{.ID}}" value="yes" {{if .Highlight}}checked{{end}}>{{.Name}} · {{.Company}}</label>{{else}}<p>No accepted program speakers found.</p>{{end}}</div></fieldset>
<fieldset><legend>Delivered sessions, popular talks &amp; core panels</legend><label class="check-label"><input type="checkbox" name="program_reviewed" value="yes" {{if .ProgramReviewed}}checked{{end}}>I have reviewed the delivery checkboxes for the complete program.</label><p>Delivery totals remain blank until reviewed. Only sessions with an end time in the past can be confirmed.</p><div class="editor-grid"><label>Comparable view metric<select name="analytics_metric"><option value="">Choose metric</option><option {{if eq (index .Saved "analytics_metric") "YouTube views"}}selected{{end}}>YouTube views</option><option {{if eq (index .Saved "analytics_metric") "X video views"}}selected{{end}}>X video views</option></select></label><label>Reporting period<input name="analytics_period" value="{{index .Saved "analytics_period"}}" placeholder="Lifetime through date, or exact date range" maxlength="12000"></label><label>Export date<input type="date" name="analytics_date" value="{{index .Saved "analytics_date"}}"></label><label>Analytics source<input name="analytics_source" value="{{index .Saved "analytics_source"}}" placeholder="Channel/account and export reference" maxlength="12000"></label></div>
{{range .Sessions}}<article class="session-editor"><h3>{{.Title}}</h3><p>{{.Kind}} · {{.Speakers}}</p><div class="editor-grid"><label class="check-label"><input type="checkbox" name="delivered_{{.ID}}" value="yes" {{if .Delivered}}checked{{end}}>Delivered</label>{{if eq .Kind "panel"}}<label class="check-label"><input type="checkbox" name="panel_{{.ID}}" value="yes" {{if .Core}}checked{{end}}>Feature this panel</label>{{end}}<label>Views<input name="views_{{.ID}}" type="number" min="0" max="1000000000000" value="{{with .Views}}{{.}}{{end}}" placeholder="Not supplied"></label></div><label>Why this session matters<textarea name="session_note_{{.ID}}" rows="2" maxlength="12000">{{.Note}}</textarea></label></article>{{else}}<p>No accepted program sessions found.</p>{{end}}</fieldset>
<fieldset><legend>Judge highlights</legend><p>Portraits and names come from existing profiles. No substitute portraits are generated.</p>{{range .Judges}}<label>{{.Name}} · {{.Role}}<textarea name="judge_note_{{.ID}}" rows="2" maxlength="12000" placeholder="Relevant expertise, contribution, or an approved quote">{{.Note}}</textarea></label>{{else}}<p>No judge assignments found.</p>{{end}}</fieldset><button>Save event draft</button></form></details>
<main>
<header class="cover report-page"><div class="cover-ticker">• bitcoin++ • event report • open-source builders • technical conversations • hackathons • community •</div><div class="cover-edition"><strong>Event report</strong><span>{{.Event.Location}}</span></div><div class="cover-wordmark">bitcoin++</div><span class="cover-spark" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><div class="cover-bottom"><div><p class="eyebrow">{{.Event.Period}}</p><h1>{{.Event.Title}}</h1><p class="partners">Prepared for NYDIG · HRF · Btrust</p></div><p class="cover-tagline">Built together.<br>Developing the frontier of bitcoin.</p></div><p class="draft-mark">{{if .Preview}}LAYOUT DRAFT · Unavailable metrics remain blank.{{else}}WORKING DRAFT · Confirm narrative, program delivery, and source coverage before sharing.{{end}}</p></header>
<section class="report-page scorecard"><div class="page-rail"><strong>bitcoin++ event report</strong><span>§01 / the event in numbers</span><b>{{.Event.Tag}}</b></div><h2>Who came.<br>What got built.</h2><div class="metric-grid">{{range .Metrics}}<article><strong>{{.Value}}</strong><span>{{.Label}}</span><small>{{.Note}}</small></article>{{end}}</div>{{with index .Saved "applications_source"}}<p class="small">Applications source: {{.}}</p>{{end}}<p class="small">{{if not .Preview}}{{.Registrations}} registrations counted before account deletion · {{.Challenges}} published sponsor challenges. {{end}}Dashes mean not supplied or not reviewed, not zero.</p></section>
{{range .Sections}}<section class="report-page story" data-section="{{.Key}}"><div class="page-rail"><strong>bitcoin++ event report</strong><span>/ {{.Key}}</span><b>{{$.Event.Tag}}</b></div><h2>{{.Title}}</h2><div class="story-text">{{.Text}}</div>
{{if eq .Key "program"}}<h3 class="subheading">Highlighted speakers</h3><div class="people-grid">{{$shown := false}}{{range $.Speakers}}{{if .Highlight}}{{$shown = true}}{{template "report_person" .}}{{end}}{{end}}{{if not $shown}}<p class="empty-note">Select speaker highlights from this event’s program in the editor.</p>{{end}}</div>{{end}}
{{if eq .Key "panels"}}<div class="panel-list">{{range $.Panels}}<article><p class="eyebrow">Panel discussion</p><h3>{{.Title}}</h3><p>{{.Speakers}}</p>{{with .Note}}<p class="editorial-note">{{.}}</p>{{end}}{{template "report_recordings" .}}</article>{{else}}<p class="empty-note">Choose this event’s core panel discussions in the editor.</p>{{end}}</div>{{end}}
{{if eq .Key "hackathon"}}<div class="award-summary"><span><b>{{if $.Preview}}—{{else}}{{$.Teams}}{{end}}</b> submitted project teams</span><span><b>{{if $.Preview}}—{{else}}{{$.Sats}}{{end}}</b> sats recorded as distributed</span></div><h3 class="subheading">The winning projects</h3><div class="winner-grid">{{range $.Winners}}<article class="winner-card">{{if .Image}}<img src="{{.Image}}" alt="{{.Title}} project image">{{end}}<p class="eyebrow">{{.Awards}}</p><h3>{{.Title}}</h3><p>{{.Description}}</p>{{with .Members}}<p class="small">Built by {{.}}</p>{{end}}<p><strong>{{if $.Preview}}—{{else}}{{.Sats}}{{end}}</strong> sats recorded as distributed</p><div class="report-links">{{if .GitHub}}<a href="{{.GitHub}}">Explore the code ↗</a>{{end}}{{if .Demo}}<a href="{{.Demo}}">Project / demo ↗</a>{{end}}</div></article>{{else}}<p class="empty-note">No finalized winning projects found in the event records. Reconcile historical results before publication.</p>{{end}}</div>{{end}}
{{if eq .Key "judges"}}<div class="people-grid judge-grid">{{range $.Judges}}{{template "report_person" .}}{{else}}<p class="empty-note">Judge highlights will use this event’s assigned judges and profile photos.</p>{{end}}</div>{{end}}
<footer>NYDIG · HRF · Btrust <span>bitcoin++ / {{$.Event.Tag}}</span></footer></section>{{if eq .Key "note"}}{{range $.Charts}}<section class="report-page chart-page" data-chart="{{.Kind}}"><div class="page-rail"><strong>bitcoin++ event report</strong><span>/ {{.Unit}}</span><b>{{$.Event.Tag}}</b></div><h2>{{.Title}}</h2><p class="chart-note">{{.Note}}</p>{{if .Rows}}<figure class="report-chart"><figcaption>{{.Unit}} · linear scale from 0 to {{.Maximum}}</figcaption>{{range .Rows}}<div class="chart-row"><div class="chart-label"><div>{{if .URL}}<a href="{{.URL}}">{{.Label}}</a>{{else}}<span>{{.Label}}</span>{{end}}{{with .Detail}}<small>{{.}}</small>{{end}}</div><strong>{{.Value}}</strong></div><svg viewBox="0 0 100 3" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect class="bar-track" width="100" height="3"/><rect class="bar-fill" width="{{.Width}}" height="3"/></svg></div>{{end}}</figure>{{else}}<div class="chart-empty"><span>Data pending</span><p>{{.Empty}}</p></div>{{end}}</section>{{end}}
{{end}}{{end}}
<section class="report-page methodology"><div class="page-rail"><strong>bitcoin++ event report</strong><span>/ sources &amp; definitions</span><b>{{.Event.Tag}}</b></div><h2>A clear account<br>of the gathering.</h2><dl><dt>Event and edition</dt><dd>{{.Event.Title}} · {{.Event.Location}} · {{.Event.Period}}. Generated {{.Generated}}. Live records may change; save the PDF to preserve the edition you send.</dd><dt>Attendance</dt><dd>Unique checked-in attendees are deduplicated by person or email. Historical attendance survives account deletion. Daily attendance is not collected.</dd><dt>Program and applications</dt><dd>Talks include keynotes; workshops and panels are separate. Delivered counts require an editor’s complete program review. The proposal table also contains invitations and admin-created sessions, so an independently verified intake count supplies the application metric. Archived and unaccepted sessions are excluded.</dd><dt>People and popularity</dt><dd>Volunteer crew counts unique people assigned to shifts, not confirmed attendance. Highlighted speakers and panels are editorial choices. Popular sessions are ranked only within the imported analytics set using one metric, source, period, and export date. Views do not establish in-room popularity.</dd><dt>Hackathon teams, awards, and payouts</dt><dd>Project teams count submitted/advanced projects; the same team submitting multiple projects may count more than once. Participants are distinct members of those projects. Winning cards require finalized results and non-archived awarded prizes. Sats count distribution records of type sats marked sent or claimed, not announced prizes or independently verified settlement. External, pooled, or historical payouts require reconciliation.</dd><dt>Portraits and evidence</dt><dd>Speaker and judge photos come from existing profiles. Missing photos are marked explicitly. Confirm photo rights, names, affiliations, quotes, and historical data coverage before sending. No private contact or payout details are included.</dd></dl><p class="closing">Thank you for helping the people building Bitcoin find one another.</p></section>
</main>{{end}}</body></html>
{{define "report_person"}}<article class="person-card">{{if .Photo}}<img src="{{.Photo}}" alt="Portrait of {{.Name}}">{{else}}<div class="portrait-missing">Portrait not supplied</div>{{end}}<h3>{{.Name}}</h3>{{with .Company}}<p>{{.}}</p>{{end}}{{with .Role}}<p class="eyebrow">{{.}}</p>{{end}}{{with .Note}}<p class="editorial-note">{{.}}</p>{{end}}</article>{{end}}
{{define "report_recordings"}}<div class="report-links">{{if .WatchURL}}<a href="{{.WatchURL}}">Watch recording ↗</a>{{end}}{{if .YouTube}}<a href="{{.YouTube}}">Watch on YouTube ↗</a>{{end}}{{if .X}}<a href="{{.X}}">Watch on X ↗</a>{{end}}</div>{{end}}
